<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>AgroSense - Login</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="login-page">
  <div class="login-hero">
    <div class="login-hero-icon login-float login-float--1"><i class="bi bi-droplet-fill"></i></div>
    <div class="login-hero-icon login-float login-float--2"><i class="bi bi-thermometer-half"></i></div>
    <div class="login-hero-icon login-float login-float--3"><i class="bi bi-broadcast"></i></div>
    <div class="login-hero-icon login-float login-float--4"><i class="bi bi-cloud-sun-fill"></i></div>
    <div class="login-hero-icon login-float login-float--5"><i class="bi bi-flower2"></i></div>

    <div class="login-hero-content">
      <div class="login-hero-brand">
        <i class="bi bi-flower2"></i>
        <span>AgroSense</span>
      </div>
      <h1>Cultiva con inteligencia</h1>
      <p>Monitorea humedad, temperatura y el estado de tus sensores en tiempo real, desde un solo panel.</p>

      <ul class="login-features">
        <li><span class="login-feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-activity"></i></span> Monitoreo en tiempo real</li>
        <li><span class="login-feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-bell-fill"></i></span> Alertas automáticas</li>
        <li><span class="login-feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-grid-1x2-fill"></i></span> Gestión centralizada</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="login-panel">
    <div class="auth-card">
      <div class="auth-icon"><i class="bi bi-flower2"></i></div>
      <h1>AgroSense Admin</h1>
      <p class="auth-subtitle">Inicia sesión para continuar</p>

      <% if (error) { %>
        <p class="auth-message auth-message--error"><%= error %></p>
      <% } %>

      <form method="POST" action="/login">
        <div class="input-icon-group">
          <i class="bi bi-envelope-fill"></i>
          <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Correo electrónico" required>
        </div>
        <div class="input-icon-group">
          <i class="bi bi-lock-fill"></i>
          <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="Contraseña" required>
        </div>
        <button type="submit">Ingresar</button>
      </form>

      <p class="auth-link">¿No tienes cuenta? <a href="/register">Regístrate</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
